 * (temperament class — Deva/Manushya/Rakshasa, see Matching\
 * NakshatraAttributes::GANA, kept consistent with the table this codebase
 * already uses for Kundali Matching) rather than generic filler. See
 * MarriageTemplates' docblock for the multi-locale shape rationale.
